# Installation Instructions

Please refer to [`INSTALL.md`](INSTALL.md) for complete, cross-platform installation and building instructions covering:
- Linux (Ubuntu, Debian, Fedora, Arch, Universal AppImage)
- macOS (Apple Silicon M-series & Intel, native `Jazz++.app` bundle)
- Windows (Windows 10/11 x64, MSVC, portable package)

Quick CMake build command:
```bash
cmake -B build -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release
cmake --build build --parallel
ctest --test-dir build --output-on-failure
```
